# cross-lib-activity-missing — Lib B (the SHARED disposition library).
library "Shared".

// The Shared library is REAL and enters the closure (Root's decision references
// it), and it DOES define an activity — but NOT the one Root asks for. So the
// library resolves while the qualified ACTIVITY name does not.
activity "Shared Deny":
- request CPGCommunicationRequest.
- with `Denied.`.
